+ compared-right SyntaxId
    - tree ASTBuilder
    - syntax SyntaxId

` The right side of an ordering, or nothing for any other expression.
match tree.nodes[syntax]
    | .node-binary-expression(previous)
        if is-glt-compare-op(previous.op) then previous.rhs else 0
    ??
        0

